WEBVTT

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:31.590
You married your
teacher, right?

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.360
I want to know in
detail how you did it.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.790
I want to learn from
your experience.

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:41.560
Before that, Yagami--

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:44.590
Do you really love Godai?

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:45.330
Yes!

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.250
You're just pestering him
for fun, aren't you?

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.170
No way.

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.420
You're confused.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:56.780
Of course not.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.170
What's so good about him?

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.140
Is it wrong?

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:05.980
Is it wrong for me
to love Mr. Godai?

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.700
N-No, it's not wrong...

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.360
but when I see what you do--

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:14.410
Am I doing something wrong?

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.700
You're going overboard.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.290
Well...

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.740
That's why I want to know...

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:26.980
from someone who succeeded
in a student-teacher romance...

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:29.170
how I should proceed properly.

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:33.850
It's late.

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.260
You have school tomorrow, don't you?

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.540
Uh... Could you let go?

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.010
Don't be shy.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.040
Hey!

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.950
--Yagami, good morning!
--'Morning!

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:08.790
Lovey-dovey so early
in the morning?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.490
How was your morning
coffee together?

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:13.760
Delicious!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:24.960
What?

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.170
Just come!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.940
H-Hey... Y-You didn't really
stay over at Mr. Godai's--

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:34.640
You bet I did.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.660
No! Y-You mean you
slept with Mr. Godai?!

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:46.700
So, tell!

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.230
Hey! Don't make up stories!

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.700
G-Good morning.

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.170
Good morning.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.730
Oops! It's Ms. Kamiogi!

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.460
Let's go.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.230
What was that all about?

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.800
It's not what y--

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.290
Let's hear it in my office.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:16.140
Oh, man... And it's my
last day of student-teaching.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:30.640
I told you many times, Uncle!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.200
I know you just want me
to meet her, but I--

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.870
Listen, I'm in love
with someone.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.970
Oops! I have to go!

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.100
Bye, Uncle!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.200
So...

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.960
today, we say goodbye...

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:07.660
to our student teachers.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:13.770
I got that straight
with Ms. Kamiogi...

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.390
but Yagami--

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.380
I bet she's going to keep
pestering me at Maison Ikkoku.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:26.320
Huh? In the widow's room?

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.260
Yeah.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:29.450
Oh. That's lame.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.000
That doesn't count.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:36.370
I had a straight
talk with her.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:40.700
What about you?

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.840
Are you in love
with Mr. Godai?

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:47.680
Well?

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.470
You love him, don't you?

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:50.600
I--

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.750
I--
N-Not really.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.190
Great!

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:00.350
So it's unrequited love
For Mr. Godai.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:06.100
But you didn't
even "do" anything.

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:08.960
And you're not gonna
see him around school anymore.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:13.160
Oh, no. We're late
for homeroom.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.200
Yeah.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.270
I know.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:23.010
I won't see him in
school anymore.

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:27.890
I'll have to keep visiting him
at Maison Ikkoku.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.210
I'll have to be strong.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.890
I wonder if
I'm strong enough.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:39.660
CONGRATS ON YOUR ENGAGEMENT
YAGAMI & MR. GODAI!!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.510
Where were you?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.590
Bathroom!

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:48.370
You, too?

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:50.880
Congrats, Yagami!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:54.100
We heard about you
and Mr. Godai.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.400
How do you feel?

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.910
Tell us about last night!

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:00.210
C'mon, Tell us!

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:03.430
What are you
talking about?

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:07.220
You slept over at
Mr. Godai's, right?

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.000
Last night?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.330
The word is out.

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.820
I slept in
the manager's room!

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:31.120
So this is Mr. Godai's last day
as a student-teacher.

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.970
I'm handing out these pieces of paper,
so by this afternoon...

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.250
please write your
evaluation of him...

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.410
and turn them in to
your class representative.

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:39.580
Class Representative...

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.830
please take the
evaluations to Mr. Godai.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:42.700
Yes.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:04.450
I wish Ms. Otonashi
would make up her mind.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:08.640
Why so glum, Mitaka?

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.710
I-It's nothing.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.780
By the way, whatever happened to
Godai and that high-school girl?

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:17.580
Oh, that?
She slept over last night.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.630
Slept over?!

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:20.890
In Godai's room?

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:25.630
You curious?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.390
N-No. Not really.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.310
The manager let her
stay in her room.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.740
Of course.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:33.910
I tell ya, young girls these days.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:37.200
Manager was very upset.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:38.550
Kyoko was?

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.910
Today's Godai's last day
student-teaching...

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.840
but that girl--
She's not goin' away.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:46.060
Is that so?

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:51.020
Shun!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:52.810
Uncle!

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.800
Why are you here?

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:57.780
I got nowhere with you
on the phone.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.170
This is not a good time.
I'm working now.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.940
I just want you to
look at her photos.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:07.150
You're wasting your time.
I'm not interested.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.910
Listen, Shun. She's from
a highly respected family.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.420
She went to an
excellent women's college.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.470
Twenty-one years old.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:15.610
She said she would
really like to meet you.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.610
You told me that already.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.250
W-What?!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.710
Did you hear that?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.990
Coach Mitaka's being
set up for marriage!

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.190
Isn't he dating Kyoko?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:27.620
Set up for marriage?

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:33.170
Anyway, let's not talk here.

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.740
They're just snapshots.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.650
She's fairly pretty.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:50.580
Young and cute.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.380
She seems a bit
naive, though--

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:55.750
Mrs. Ichinose!
You're being rude.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.770
Aren't you curious,
too, Manager?

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.920
Take a look.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.500
Her family is a very good
customer at my bank.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:07.230
Fine.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:08.600
Hey!

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:09.910
I'm sure
turning her down...

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:11.650
would put you in
an bad position at work.

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:13.580
I'll just meet her.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:18.380
Great. I'll make
the arrangements.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.690
Tomorrow is an auspicious day.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.950
Let's visit them
at their home tomorrow.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:27.960
COACHES' LOUNGE

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.030
So... You wanted
to talk to me?

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:37.170
Don't you have anything
to say to me?

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.810
The only person
who can stop me...

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.180
Is you.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:52.150
Your uncle will be
in a bad position...

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.740
if you don't
meet her, right?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.930
Do you think that's
the only reason I said yes?

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:03.690
Ms. Otonashi
have you already...

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:07.350
chosen Godai?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:16.130
You're waiting for Godai
to graduate and find a job.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:25.600
What am I waiting for?

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.880
Isn't that right?

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.810
Aren't you waiting
for Godai?

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:46.620
Well?

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.280
I hadn't even
considered such a--

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:55.740
Are you telling
me the truth?

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:56.840
Yes.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.710
I'm glad to hear that.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.840
I'm sorry I
asked you to stay.

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:05.750
Let me drive you home.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:09.220
But I need to stop
somewhere today.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:10.700
That's fine.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:14.070
If I can spend one more minute...
one more second with you--

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.990
Th-Thank you.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:23.000
Maybe this will help
move things along.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:27.520
I have to give her
a push like this.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:30.920
Otherwise, she'll leave me hanging
for five to ten years--easy.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.250
Thank you for waiting.

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:34.980
No problem.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:40.560
Soichiro needs to
get vaccinated today...

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.900
so I had him
tied up in the back.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:14.670
Soichiro's excited to see
his favorite man.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:18.200
I-I'm sorry!
I just remembered an urgent--

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:31.780
Oops! Look what I've done!

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:32.790
Are you all right?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.890
I'm fine.
No problem.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:38.940
I'll go with you.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:41.550
I'll be fine.

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:44.430
I-I feel bad.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.320
I-I'll be fine.
Really.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:51.790
I'll see you when Soichiro
doesn't need a vaccination.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.090
S-See you!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.100
Did everybody turn in
a teacher evaluation?

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:01.330
I'm taking them.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.470
Okay.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.100
Your final tryst?

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:05.830
Good luck.

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.910
Say what you want.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:19.260
How sad.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:23.480
I thought you were
gonna go for it.

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.560
You really let us down.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.370
You don't care anymore, do you?

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.780
I thought it over.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:40.430
I lost interest while you
were having fun teasing me.

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:42.680
Bye!

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:48.620
She has such a short
attention span.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:53.090
This is everybody's evaluation.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.660
Oh, thanks.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.220
We have to talk.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.170
Mr. Godai.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.220
Y-Yes?

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.550
I'm sorry about everything.

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.280
Huh?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.880
I don't know
what came over me.

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:19.760
I don't know what
I was thinking.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:26.180
I know I was a pain in your butt,
but I won't do it anymore.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.530
Take care.

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:38.190
Bye!

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.410
Bye-bye!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:48.830
Bye-bye.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:57.160
It's almost disappointing
to see her get over me so fast.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.660
Thank you very much.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:03.260
Take care, and good luck to you.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.350
Thank you.

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:17.650
I guess it's time to say
good-bye to this school.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:22.440
She was a good girl, really.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:41.900
Thanks to you, I got chewed out
by Ms. Kamiogi a lot...

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:45.870
but it was fun.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.020
You're just gonna
let him leave?

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:58.350
Why don't you
say something to him?

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.290
It's all right.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.130
I'm over him.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.440
Oh?

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.380
Welcome back.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:32.320
Hello.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:36.210
So you finished
student-teaching?

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.750
Uh-huh.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.980
Is something wrong?

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:45.520
No. I'm sorry I caused
a lot of trouble...

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:48.030
but I think Yagami
is completely over me.

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.340
High-school girls nowadays
sure move on fast.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.110
It's hard to believe
isn't it?

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:00.810
She was so in love with you.

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:26.190
Your students evaluated you?

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:29.910
I think I can guess
what they wrote.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.970
Like, "You were
a nervous wreck,"

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:33.580
and "I couldn't understand
what you were teaching."

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.710
I'm not cut out
to be a teacher.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:42.590
"Have a blissful..."

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.420
"Have a blissful life
with Yagami."

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.060
I see.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:49.790
What?

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:52.900
These are very
important evaluations...

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.310
written by my students.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:58.770
Really? And you can't even
share them with others?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:01.700
They weren't supposed to be--

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.330
Huh? Lemme see.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.000
"Take good care of Yagami."

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.770
"Mr. Godai, you horny pig"?

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:08.150
"You better not run away."

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.440
"Invite us to your wedding."

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.590
"You better take
full responsibility."

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.620
What responsibility?

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.510
Huh? What responsibility?

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.070
Hey! Let go of me!

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.070
Go to your room and watch TV.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.180
Why?

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.960
We're going to have a talk
amongst adults. Go to your room.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:33.170
You mean none of them took
my classes seriously?!

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:36.880
The truth is written right here.

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.880
Right, Godai?

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:41.350
Yagami?

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:05.680
A long good-bye?

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:10.000
See? She's over me.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:12.080
You look disappointed.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:14.340
N-No way!

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.180
Yeah.

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:19.920
Someone's here for you.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:25.720
Yagami.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.130
Hello!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:32.490
I came to pick up the bag
that I left here.

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:33.660
Oh, yeah.

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:37.260
I forgot to write something
on my evaluation.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:47.000
Well, Mr. Godai...

00:20:47.090 --> 00:20:48.040
so long!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.120
W-What?

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:01.930
I can't help it. The thought
of you made me cry.

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:09.930
"So long. Good-bye."

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:12.310
"See you later."

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.140
Aren't you happy?
She'll be back.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:17.760
Your life is so complicated.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:18.820
That girl's not goin' away...

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.680
Mitaka's getting
set up for marriage--

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:24.160
What? M-Mitaka's
getting set up for marriage?

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:27.180
Y-Yes. That's what we heard.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.820
I see.

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:34.370
N-Not that it really concerns me.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:37.930
Besides, it doesn't mean
that he will get married.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:40.430
He's just being
introduced, right?

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:43.020
Th-That's right.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.730
He couldn't marry everybody
he gets introduced to!

00:21:55.930 --> 00:22:00.620
She's quite concerned, isn't she?

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.080
Of course.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:05.280
The man she's been involved with
is getting set up for marriage.

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:09.520
You can't blame her.

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:11.680
This could actually
heat up the relationship

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:16.310
between Mitaka
and the Manager.

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:18.400
N-No way!

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:19.810
Well, you know
what they say...

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:22.700
if pushing doesn't work,
try pulling back.

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:49.070
What's the matter?
You look so down.

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:50.640
I'm fine.

00:22:51.820 --> 00:22:55.580
Can't you look
a little happier?

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:56.940
S-Sure.

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:38.780
My name is Asuna Kujo.

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:48.160
You don't want to see her again?
Don't be ridiculous.

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:52.020
She wants to pursue
this relationship.

00:23:53.080 --> 00:23:55.340
I have made my decision.

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:59.500
Next: "The Princess Cometh!
Mitaka is Her Prince Charming"

00:24:00.010 --> 00:24:02.580
I wish to spend the
rest of my life with that man.
